creased exponentially\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Differences in the percentages of infections by vaccination status were calculated using chi-square tests for categorical variables and Kruskal-Wallis tests for medians\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Age-adjusted rolling 7-day SARS-CoV-2 infection and hospitalization rates were estimated by vaccination status.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Adjusted rates were calculated using 2018 population estimates and were standardized using the year 2000 U.S. standard population\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"p-values <0.05 were considered statistically significant.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}